   "t": "andan obsesionados buscando {{medalia|pl}}."
  },
  {
   "i": 1070,
   "src": "52a0083d44ae",
   "t": "Aquí ya pasa bastante gente ahora,"
  },
  {
   "i": 1073,
   "src": "e8ee78c3622e",
   "t": "y han pisoteado la hierba, ¿no crees?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1078,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1084,
   "src": "e4751a182444",
   "t": "...Tal vez."
  },
  {
   "i": 1091,
   "src": "1e52ed43bbf1",
   "t": "{{mio}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1100,
   "src": "5ef090c1fb4b",
   "t": "¿Hay algo escrito aquí?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1107,
   "src": "f1f3a69763ae",
   "t": "{{exploration_club_pres_kunigiku}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1116,
   "src": "6447006caffb",
   "t": "Mmm."
  },
  {
   "i": 1124,
   "src": "7ebb13a41f49",
   "t": "Ni hablar, la pintura está descascarada."
  },
  {
   "i": 1127,
   "src": "57a87e7c4ac9",
   "t": "Es de la era minera, ¿no? Es viejo."
  },
  {
   "i": 1135,
   "src": "0612568e2fad",
   "t": "...Ah."
  },
  {
   "i": 1140,
   "src": "c12c268fadf2",
   "t": "{{ryoma}}"
  },
  {
   "i": 1146,
   "src": "6ba141a6dc7e",
   "t": "¿Y ahora qué pasa?"
  },
  {
   "i": 1154,
   "src": "159d74d41dda",
   "t": "¡Hay un camino! Todavía está oculto"
  },
  {
   "i": 1157,
   "src": "2a3065a9eb9b",
   "t": "por la hierba y cuesta verlo, pero..."
